        "code": {
          "text": "Eye examination by video"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Telehealth video examination was limited. Mild bilateral lid margin erythema, especially of the upper lids. Sclerae appeared mildly injected, although the image was intermittently pixelated. No obvious lid swelling or chalazion; crusting not visible at the time of examination. Extraocular movements grossly full."
      }
